<title>SWEDEN: 7 Foreningsbanken shares for 2 in new bank-source.</title>
<headline>7 Foreningsbanken shares for 2 in new bank-source.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven A-shares in Foreningsbanken will give two shares in the newly merged bank with Swedbank, a market source close to the merger negotiations told Reuters.</p>
<p>The source said Foreningsbanken would also give a four crown bonus dividend for each A-series share.</p>
<p>Three preference shares in Foreningsbanken would give one share in the new bank, to be called ForeningsSparbanken, the source said.  </p>
<p>The banks were to release details at a press conference at 1100 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
